  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut\n• the potato (unpeeled) into 1cm fries. Place the\n• fries and corn on an oven tray lined with baking\n• paper. Season with salt and pepper and drizzle\n• with olive oil. Toss to coat, then bake until tender,\n• 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: Cut the potato to size so it cooks in time.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fb20d9e3787c23f14698798/step-c0075aad.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are baking, finely chop the\n• garlic. Grate the carrot (unpeeled). Finely chop\n• the coriander. Thinly slice the spring onion.\n• Drain and rinse the chickpeas. Slice lime into\n• wedges (see ingredients).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fb20d9e3787c23f14698798/step-f47253ea.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, place the drained chickpeas\n• and egg. Mash with a potato masher until the\n• chickpeas are broken up. Add the garlic, grated\n• carrot, coriander (reserve a pinch for garnish!),\n• spring onion, Tex-Mex spice blend, plain flour,\n• the salt and fine breadcrumbs. Mix until well\n• combined and the mixture is sticking together.\n• Using damp hands, form a large spoonful of the\n• mixture into a ball, then flatten into a 1cm-thick\n• patty. Repeat with the remaining mixture, you\n• should get 3-4 patties per person.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fb20d9e3787c23f14698798/step-2b77e248.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of\n• olive oil over a medium-high heat. When the oil is\n• hot, cook the chickpea patties, in batches, until\n• golden, 2-3 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fb20d9e3787c23f14698798/step-15ae18d4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the patties are cooking, roughly chop the\n• cucumber and tomato. Once the corn is cool\n• enough to handle, slice the kernels off the cob. In\n• a medium bowl, combine the cucumber, tomato,\n• corn, mixed salad leaves, a good squeeze of lime\n• juice and a small drizzle of olive oil. Season with\n• salt and pepper. Toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fb20d9e3787c23f14698798/step-84e019c9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the fries between plates and serve alongside\n• the Mexican chickpea patties and corn salad. Serve\n• with the smokey aioli and remaining lime wedges.\n• Garnish with the reserved coriander.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/5fb20d9e3787c23f14698798/step-f4ca7eff.jpg"
    }
  ]
